From: Marc Lainez <marc.lainez@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: pipeline: camss: Qualcomm VFE pixel path

Add a pipeline handler for the camss VFE pixel path, which debayers,
white balances, colour corrects and scales in hardware and outputs NV12.
Each camera takes its own CSID, ISPIF and VFE. The handler picks the
smallest sensor mode that covers the output within the 4288 pixel input
line, downscales and centre crops in the VFE, and keeps widths to
multiples of 16 pixels for the write masters.

The simple pipeline handler no longer claims qcom-camss.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
